; ==========================================
; First Steps in Thai / ไทย (th)
; MultiLang-ASM Kids
; ==========================================

sai klong 10       ; Put 10 candies in the box
buak klong 5        ; Get 5 more candies (15)
lop klong 2        ; Eat 2 candies (13 left!)
sadang klong         ; Show the final candy count!
